# Large binary deliverables — kept locally, not committed (bloat).
*.zip
submission_staging/
multimodal_full*/*.step
# Per-fixture 3D exports + input-drawing copies are heavy + redundant (drawings are
# the public CADGenBench dataset inputs). The renders (build screenshots), gallery,
# and manifest ARE committed as the reviewable visual deliverable.
artifacts_*/**/output.step
artifacts_*/**/output.stl
artifacts_*/**/output.glb
artifacts_*/**/drawing.png
